{"server":"tw","storyId":"act41side_level_act41side_06_end","groupId":"act41side","stageId":"act41side_06","title":"失路人","storyCode":"EA-6","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act41side/level_act41side_06_end.txt","sourceHash":"5ba66928b33a40cdb861bbaf330efcb519b989d123761e988e01dde0d6a1616e","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g5_remains_outside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您送我送得夠遠，這裡已經是守靈人的聚落了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“放逐王”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你姐姐喚醒了我，如果你覺得我聒噪，自然也可以一把火送我回去接著睡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"葦草！"},{"type":"narration","text":"不遠處，金髮佩洛從馱獸背上一躍而下，向紅龍所在的方向疾奔而來。\n在她身後以馱獸所拖曳的是一輛臨時拼湊的板車，上面排布堆疊著長長的木箱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——布莉吉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼來了這裡？你身後拖著的那些是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……棺材？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“放逐王”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，棺材。涅梅絲讓我帶著這些棺材來找守靈人。他們還在遺跡裡面嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"紅龍，你身邊是不是站著什麼人？我聞到了熟悉的燒焦味，剛剛好像還聽見你和人說話——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“放逐王”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，只有我一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死了的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕你拉住他的手，他也拚了命要把肩膀扯脫臼，好用牙去咬他臆想中的仇人的傢伙，或是被他們撕成碎片的倒楣鬼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有提奧，涅梅絲最終還是找到了他，他……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就好像事情自然而然地到了這一步，夏末節的夜晚就要到來，篝火馬上就要燒到最旺了一樣……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"紅龍抬頭朝納斯爾紗所在的方向望去。此刻遠遠地竟也能看見一個渺茫的影，勾勒出屬於紫火燃燒的輪廓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再這樣下去，可能很快連棺材都不夠城裡用了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g10_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但願布莉吉已經到了城外……但願林中沒那麼多霧，布莉吉能從小路離開……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，這些沒用到的武器還堆在庫林屋內，不能被人看見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個……這個是沒用光的燃料……爆炸物？也許拉芙希妮殿下回來時能用得到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不用，堡壘中所有的僕役也都染上了紫火，而且那條貪婪的紅龍早就把他們遣散了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"簡直就像……等著拉芙希妮殿下回來和她做個了斷一樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者……陷阱？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……羅里？你來幹嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是……涅梅絲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，是我。我在整理庫林的遺物，如果你沒事就先離開——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叛徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你瘋了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，對，你瘋了，我們大家都瘋了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叛徒——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還是……下不了死手，明明大家都已經和死人差不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈哈……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得先把這個傢伙拖回他自己的家，別引人注意……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g1_citystreets_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"涅梅絲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒、沒事的話，我先走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你手裡拿著什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼，我走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是尼亞爾送艾瑪的項鍊，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——我已經把麵包給她了！這種時候，麵包比項鍊還重要吧！她自願給我的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她自願的嗎？這條項鍊她一直都戴在脖子上——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不關你的事！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"涅梅絲？我還以為城裡的深池一個不剩都消失了，原來你留下來了啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也變成那種不會說話、不會走路，只會在原地待著的人了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快了。你提那些人做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今晚就要開始慶祝夏末節了，我去消失的那些人家裡看了一圈，他們那裡剩下不少好東西，剛好晚上開宴會可以用！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……夏末節？宴會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"庫林的事——呃，畢竟他那個時候已經油盡燈枯了，我也不是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們別說這些了。看，這麼多東西，夠讓許多人盡興了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"面前的人向涅梅絲打開手裡的袋子，裡面是一瓶已經結塊的瘤奶、幾個發芽許久的馬鈴薯還有幾根光禿禿的骨頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等著我，涅梅絲，還有庫林，我們一定能有一個最好的夏末節……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"直到對方的身影消失在街道轉角，涅梅絲才想起來，這個人原本是納斯爾紗附近的鄉民。\n兩年前，維多利亞人以搜查深池為名抓走了她父親的那一天，她正在準備秋收之後的豐收慶典。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g5_remains_outside"},{"type":"narration","text":"無論拉芙希妮對城中可能出現的亂象有過怎樣程度的預料，眼下聽到的轉達都已經超出她的想像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必須現在就回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我一下，我把這些人送到守靈人那裡之後，就跟你一起回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布莉吉，你確定嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城內現在已經很危險了，如果我最終失敗，那裡很可能……無人生還。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說得對，但我得回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為以前不是這樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前，城裡人也缺少吃穿，但我把信遞給他們的時候，他們會為我準備一杯水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們確實不把我當自己人，但當我講遊牧民的傳說給他們聽時，他們不會冷哼一聲走開，而是認真地聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們更不會像這幾天一樣……撕咬、毆打，就像故事裡的那些被喚醒的死人一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果城市真的死了，遊牧民又要送信給誰呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g5_remains_outside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫蘭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從納斯爾紗來的第二批遺體已經抵達，我該去做準備了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"照這樣下去，很快還會有第三批、第四批……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道我們真的什麼也不做嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說過了，守靈人不會主動偏向任何一方，不會自己做出選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"納斯爾紗人不是塔拉人嗎？為什麼在那座塔拉人的城市正在急速走向崩毀的時候，我們要袖手旁觀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你們隨紅龍歸來，你們擔憂她回去，會重蹈拉布雷德的覆轍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我們正是把拉布雷德送上絕路的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的祖先是塔拉王城內掌管典禮的祭司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將拉布雷德迎回王城的諸般事宜，正是在艾里爾不置可否的情況下，由被拉布雷德感動的祖先擅自操辦的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉布雷德死後，祖先們在七日之後為他還火，這才平息了塔拉原野上蔓延的死火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而為了永遠不忘記這段慘痛的教訓，祖先們自願離開王城，搬到拉布雷德曾經的牧場自我放逐，從此才有了守靈人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我很抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但葦草不是拉布雷德，歷史也不是永恆的循環。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果歷史真的只是循環，葦草早就已經死在了納斯爾紗的堡壘之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至，她的姐姐，那位目空一切的領袖，她不也帶領塔拉擺脫了維多利亞的統治嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人們的命運大多相似，但其中總會有決定性的不同。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“人們的命運大多相似，但其中總會有決定性的不同。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要我說，您該把這句話印在書腰上，當作登上暢銷榜第一的宣傳語。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"當然，前提是您先來把這個故事完完整整地寫下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從來都沒有想以此牟利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就算不為金錢，您也能以此收穫相當的名聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個故事的基底……發生的地點……這一切……都注定了，它不是一個能讓我來流傳散布的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，然後呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這正是我想問您的啊。然後呢？拉芙希妮回去了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從這裡開始，我看見的、我相信的、我說出口的，彼此全都背道而馳。所以，我才失去了那些故事的結局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是做得到，那還是你來吧，為這場鏡中人和紅龍的舞填上一個你喜歡的結局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦？我來講述也一樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，當然，女士，如你所願——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"作家舉起酒杯，搖晃著已經少了一大半的苦啤酒，和對面的女人碰了個杯。\n他再度嚥下苦澀，同時心不在焉地等待不存在的回甘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是我嚇到您了嗎？您突然變得有些客氣，倒是令我覺得是自己的追問不合時宜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。只是我需要告訴你，先前我們所說的一切都只是無關緊要的閒話，你能明白的，對嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"眼前的女性端坐著，一言不發。作家只能從陰影中努力去辨認對方是否依然面帶微笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還在等什麼？我這杯酒就要喝完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我陷入了和您一樣的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果您的素材和創作到此為止，我又怎麼可能把紅龍最終的命運落在紙上呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能說出口的就這麼多。我拒絕用完全杜撰的內容去為這個故事填上一個連我自己都說服不了的結尾，即使這樣會讓它缺乏結局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你也沒頭緒，就也別在此逗留了。早點離開吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是您不瞭解、記不清，還是您寧願自己從未瞭解，從未看清過？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底是什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"與其說“失去結局”，倒不如說太多的“創作”迷暈了您自己的眼睛。需要我從頭數下來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"財寶將人們誘入黑暗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"獨自將雕像拖上廣場的庫林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還有和林中黑霧相關的幾乎一切，從受拒的布莉吉、自己回城的糧車、迷路的拉芙希妮，再到城中的校官和愛布拉娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然這些“創作”讓您腦海中的一切自相矛盾，那我的確有責任引領它們通往結局的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"接下來換我為您提供自己的所見所聞，怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然不說話，我就當作您同意了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但願我補充的這些，能讓您找到自己滿意的結局。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
